    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After mysterious invaders thoroughly wreck their village, the villager leaders and a ragtag crew of survivors make a daring escape on a stolen boat. After days of drifting, they finally wash up on <strong>Shoni Island</strong>\u2014a land full of peculiar characters, baffling puzzles, and unexpected challenges. Your mission? Adapt, build, and upskill to escape this fantastical island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immerse Yourself in a Living, Breathing Ecosystem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoni Island isn\u2019t just a backdrop; it\u2019s a dynamic world where NPCs have lives of their own\u2014whether you\u2019re watching or not. Get to know these unique, opinionated characters as you manage your settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/5a6776b17b97eda3e7d01d0bdd34d0bd.poster.avif?t=1745718645\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/5a6776b17b97eda3e7d01d0bdd34d0bd.webm?t=1745718645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/5a6776b17b97eda3e7d01d0bdd34d0bd.mp4?t=1745718645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build, Farm, and Worship with a Twist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide your villagers through essential tasks like construction, farming, and the delightfully bizarre practice of god worship. Balance their needs for food, resources, and social interaction while keeping the island\u2019s moody gods\u2014Gaia (earth), Faeris (fire), Simbi (water), and Zephyr (wind)\u2014on your side. Their mood towards you can make or break your settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/f454a14233ad8cecd687c6864d0353af.poster.avif?t=1745718645\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/f454a14233ad8cecd687c6864d0353af.webm?t=1745718645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/f454a14233ad8cecd687c6864d0353af.mp4?t=1745718645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy a Stress-Free World with Genuine Humour</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoni Island is designed with player well-being at its core, offering a relaxed experience full of quirky humour and AI-driven social interactions. The game brings a nostalgic touch to strategy with its engaging puzzles and whimsical charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/70ec6b3cd00a8d5593d3fdc3aab2d7b7.poster.avif?t=1745718645\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/70ec6b3cd00a8d5593d3fdc3aab2d7b7.webm?t=1745718645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/70ec6b3cd00a8d5593d3fdc3aab2d7b7.mp4?t=1745718645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tackle Challenging Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is home to a range of unique puzzles that will truly test your strategic thinking. Each one is crafted to challenge and entertain as you uncover the secrets needed to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/e0d83bfe4e75caa6ae16924e22bb8fc0.poster.avif?t=1745718645\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/e0d83bfe4e75caa6ae16924e22bb8fc0.webm?t=1745718645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/e0d83bfe4e75caa6ae16924e22bb8fc0.mp4?t=1745718645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join our Discord Server!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the <strong>Shoni Island</strong> community on Discord to stay in the loop! Get the latest news on updates, bug fixes, upcoming events, and sneak peeks at what\u2019s coming next. Whether you\u2019re here to share feedback, ask questions, or just hang out with fellow adventurers, we\u2019d love to have you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/5854b8a3a02e4ca4d20bb454d7460ba0.avif?t=1745718645\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After mysterious invaders thoroughly wreck their village, the villager leaders and a ragtag crew of survivors make a daring escape on a stolen boat. After days of drifting, they finally wash up on <strong>Shoni Island</strong>\u2014a land full of peculiar characters, baffling puzzles, and unexpected challenges. Your mission? Adapt, build, and upskill to escape this fantastical island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immerse Yourself in a Living, Breathing Ecosystem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoni Island isn\u2019t just a backdrop; it\u2019s a dynamic world where NPCs have lives of their own\u2014whether you\u2019re watching or not. Get to know these unique, opinionated characters as you manage your settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/5a6776b17b97eda3e7d01d0bdd34d0bd.poster.avif?t=1745718645\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/5a6776b17b97eda3e7d01d0bdd34d0bd.webm?t=1745718645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/5a6776b17b97eda3e7d01d0bdd34d0bd.mp4?t=1745718645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build, Farm, and Worship with a Twist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide your villagers through essential tasks like construction, farming, and the delightfully bizarre practice of god worship. Balance their needs for food, resources, and social interaction while keeping the island\u2019s moody gods\u2014Gaia (earth), Faeris (fire), Simbi (water), and Zephyr (wind)\u2014on your side. Their mood towards you can make or break your settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/f454a14233ad8cecd687c6864d0353af.poster.avif?t=1745718645\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/f454a14233ad8cecd687c6864d0353af.webm?t=1745718645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/f454a14233ad8cecd687c6864d0353af.mp4?t=1745718645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy a Stress-Free World with Genuine Humour</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoni Island is designed with player well-being at its core, offering a relaxed experience full of quirky humour and AI-driven social interactions. The game brings a nostalgic touch to strategy with its engaging puzzles and whimsical charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/70ec6b3cd00a8d5593d3fdc3aab2d7b7.poster.avif?t=1745718645\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/70ec6b3cd00a8d5593d3fdc3aab2d7b7.webm?t=1745718645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/70ec6b3cd00a8d5593d3fdc3aab2d7b7.mp4?t=1745718645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tackle Challenging Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is home to a range of unique puzzles that will truly test your strategic thinking. Each one is crafted to challenge and entertain as you uncover the secrets needed to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/e0d83bfe4e75caa6ae16924e22bb8fc0.poster.avif?t=1745718645\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/e0d83bfe4e75caa6ae16924e22bb8fc0.webm?t=1745718645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/e0d83bfe4e75caa6ae16924e22bb8fc0.mp4?t=1745718645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join our Discord Server!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the <strong>Shoni Island</strong> community on Discord to stay in the loop! Get the latest news on updates, bug fixes, upcoming events, and sneak peeks at what\u2019s coming next. Whether you\u2019re here to share feedback, ask questions, or just hang out with fellow adventurers, we\u2019d love to have you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813990/extras/5854b8a3a02e4ca4d20bb454d7460ba0.avif?t=1745718645\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Settle, build, and survive on the enigmatic Shoni Island. Manage quirky NPCs, farm, and appease four unpredictable gods. Solve tricky puzzles, uncover hidden secrets, and balance chill with challenge in this captivating cozy survival adventure. Will you escape or become part of the island\u2019s legend?",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
